{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 42, :comments ["<b>And when they were robust.</b> A term of growing strong, as the Targum renders it: וּבְלַקִּישׁוּת. And Menachem connected it with מַחֲלָצוֹת and מַעֲטָפוֹת (Isaiah 3) — a term of wrapping a garment; that is to say, they wrap themselves in their skin and their wool and do not desire to mate with the males."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 30, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:01:22.960949091Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}